 "words": 152,
 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "Consider it nothing but joy, my brothers",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.37,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Whenever we fall into trials of every kind",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.25,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "You know the testing of your faith",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.91,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Produces endurance in our daily life",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.79,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Nothing but joy, nothing but joy",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.59,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Even when the trials come to find us",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.4,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Nothing but joy, nothing but joy",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.56,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Endurance grows and our spirits bind us",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.37,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Let endurance finish its holy work",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.23,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "So that we may be mature and complete",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.36,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Lacking nothing in this sacred path",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.31,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Where our faith is tested and made sweet",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.29,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Nothing but joy, nothing but joy",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.14,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Even when the trials come to find us",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.22,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Nothing but joy, nothing but joy",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.12,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Endurance grows and our spirits bind us",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.16,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "If any of you lacks wisdom, ask God",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.07,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "He gives generously to all without fault",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.2,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Ask in faith, without doubting or fear",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.27,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Like a wave, do not let the wind halt",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.3,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
